 2026\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0 flex-1 text-[14px] text-zinc-500 leading-[1.55]\",\"children\":\"Hands-on deep dive into OpenAI Codex CLI — config.toml schema, profiles, sandbox modes, MCP integration, agent loops, and the workflows that ship.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-auto flex items-center justify-between border-zinc-200 border-t pt-3.5 font-mono text-[10.5px] text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-[0.08em] dark:border-zinc-800\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[\"May 10, 2026\",\" · \",13,\" min\"]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-medium text-zinc-950 dark:text-white\",\"children\":[\"Read \",[\"$\",\"$L6c\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"icon\":\"$39:props:children:2:props:children:0:props:children:3:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:icon\",\"className\":\"size-3.5\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n78:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-950 mt-10\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-1.5 font-mono text-[11px] text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-[0.14em]\",\"children\":\"Google Search\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0 text-[15px] text-zinc-700 leading-[1.55] dark:text-zinc-300\",\"children\":\"See more Digital Applied analysis in your Google results by adding us as a preferred source.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1.5 self-start rounded-full border border-zinc-950 px-4 py-2 font-medium text-[14px] text-zinc-950 transition-colors hover:bg-zinc-950 hover:text-white sm:self-auto dark:border-white dark:text-white dark:hover:bg-white dark:hover:text-zinc-950\",\"href\":\"https://www.google.com/preferences/source?q=digitalapplied.com\",\"rel\":\"noopener\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"children\":[\"Add as a preferred source \",[\"$\",\"$L6c\",nul